  "description_html": "<section aria-labelledby=\"courseDescription\">\n    Offered: Spring. \n\nPrerequisite: A grade of C or better in CHEM 2134, or approval of the instructor. \n\nThis is a lab intensive course, that focuses on a variety of experimental techniques that enable the chemist to characterize and quantify many types of samples. \n\nLecture three hours, laboratory six hours.\n    \n</section>",
